    "description": "Holy Bible Light offers these key features:\r\n\r\nMorning Prayers: Provides structured prayer routines available from 12:00 AM (midnight) to 5:00 PM.\r\n\r\nNight Prayers: Offers structured prayer routines available from 5:00 PM to 12:00 AM (midnight).\r\n\r\nDaily Devotions: Offers daily insights into scripture to deepen your understanding.\r\n\r\nBible Reading: Provides the full text of the Holy Bible for your reading and study.\r\n\r\nQuiz: Tests your Bible knowledge through engaging questions, allowing you to assess and reinforce your understanding of scripture.\r\n\r\nNote-Taking and Bookmarks: Enables you to add notes and bookmarks to specific verses.",
